      "sha256": "d8f03d62e7670afb8a9f01756c4cb0074d6b3f7297622f93b789dc19ee59f78d"
    },
    "profile": {
      "id": "soviet-cn",
      "sha256": "dad8d974ba16880482f359073263269de8c405ccf8cb17dc4215fad11da44849"
    },
    "notes": [
      "本次仅打开page.grid.png一次；原生页脚53，物理页60，offset=7。",
      "页首为10. 二元不等式组，无此前n9尾题；本页正文和例1均属alg8-c2-s2-n10。",
      "图22粗框仅交机器吸附，不以像素或DPI推算物理量；图内原标签含y、x、O、3、y=x及水平/铅直细线。",
      "图22图题与正文“域）. 这就是说，所讨论的不等式组给”同一印刷横排，cap标samerow。",
      "例1不等式组之后的叙述承接下一页，p open；未独立源审、未数学审批、未图审批。"
    ],
    "unknowns": [],
    "errata": [],
    "printed_lines": 25,
    "figures": [
      {
        "id": "fig-22",
        "label": "图 22",
        "box": [
          1628,
          1851,
          571,
          590
        ]
      }
    ],
    "provenance": {
      "cap": "1",
      "normalized": true
    }
  },
  "blocks": [
    {
      "ref": "p0060#1",
      "kind": "h3",
      "label": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "box": null,
      "lines": [
        "10. 二元不等式组"
      ]
    },
    {
      "ref": "p0060#2",
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "box": null,
      "lines": [
        "我们来讨论二元不等式组：",
        "$\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}y&\\geqslant x,\\\\↵x^2+y^2&\\leqslant9.\\end{aligned}\\right.$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "ref": "p0060#3",
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "box": null,
      "lines": [
        "这个不等式组的解集合是其中各不等式的解集合的交",
        "集."
      ]
    },
    {
      "ref": "p0060#4",
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "box": null,
      "lines": [
        "我们来看看，以所讨论的不等式组的解为坐标的平面上",
        "点的集合是什么."
      ]
    },
    {
      "ref": "p0060#5",
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "box": null,
      "lines": [
        "坐标满足不等式$y\\geqslant x$的点的集合，是直线$y=x$上和位",
        "于这条直线上方的开半平面上点的集合的并集（在图22中，",
        "这个集合画水平的细线表示）. 坐标满足不等式$x^2+y^2\\leqslant9$的",
        "点的集合是圆心在坐标原点、半径为3的圆（在图22中，这个",
        "集合画铅直的细线表示）. 显然，属于",
        "由不等式组中每个不等式给出的点的",
        "集合的交集的这些点的坐标，并且只",
        "有这些点的坐标，才能满足不等式组",
        "（在图22中，和这个交集对应的是一",
        "种细线条画在另一种细线条上面的区",
        "域）. 这就是说，所讨论的不等式组给"
      ]
    },
    {
      "ref": "p0060#6",
      "kind": "fig",
      "label": "图 22",
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "box": [
        1628,
        1851,
        571,
        590
      ],
      "lines": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "p0060#7",
      "kind": "cap",
      "label": "图 22",
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "box": null,
      "lines": [
        "图 22"
      ]
    },
    {
      "ref": "p0060#8",
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "cont": true,
      "open": false,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "box": null,
      "lines": [
        "出半圆."
      ]
    },
    {
      "ref": "p0060#9",
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "box": null,
      "lines": [
        "我们再举两个例子."
      ]
    },
    {
      "ref": "p0060#10",
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "box": null,
      "lines": [
        "例1 不等式组",
        "$\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x&\\leqslant0,\\\\↵y&\\geqslant0\\end{aligned}\\right.$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "ref": "p0060#11",
      "kind": "foot",
      "label": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "box": null,
      "lines": [
        "53"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
