      "lines": [
        "例2 不等式组",
        "$\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}y&\\geqslant2x-3,\\\\↵y&\\leqslant2x+2\\end{aligned}\\right.$",
        "给出由直线$y=2x-3$和$y=2x+2$为边界的带（图24）."
      ]
    },
    {
      "ref": "p0061#7",
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "131",
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "box": null,
      "lines": [
        "131. 下列变量$x$和$y$的取值数对$(x,y)$是不等式组",
        "$\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}2x+3y&>-1,\\\\↵x^2+y^2&\\leqslant2\\end{aligned}\\right.$",
        "的解吗？",
        "а) $(0,0)$； б) $(-1,0.5)$； в) $(1,-1)$； г) $\\left(\\frac{1}{3},1\\right)$."
      ]
    },
