{
  "page": "0062",
  "meta": {
    "schema": "ld-s10y-lesson/page@3",
    "book": "8a",
    "page": 62,
    "printed_page": 55,
    "source": {
      "pdf": "8a 苏联十年制学校数学教材 代数 八年级.pdf",
      "pdf_sha256": "5978388efc80df4085400f80d5912f710efb052a806222633b172b0a9479b071",
      "pdf_page": 62
    },
    "render": {
      "dpi": 300,
      "w": 2480,
      "h": 3509,
      "sha256": "6d597c70694800f924d752bc1e8236a7fb802f3b934cd2282900ae9aa0f151db"
    },
    "profile": {
      "id": "soviet-cn",
      "sha256": "dad8d974ba16880482f359073263269de8c405ccf8cb17dc4215fad11da44849"
    },
    "notes": [
      "本次仅打开page.grid.png一次；原生页脚55，物理页62，offset=7。",
      "133 ex cont承接p0061；134、135、136均属alg8-c2-s2-n10。",
      "133及134的并排方程组共享印刷横排：各横排只计一次，完整保留每一组方程；每对方程组只在较长的一组放对应↵。",
      "134原生分题标号按左上、右上、左下、右下为а)、б)、б)、г)，第三项保留重复的б)，不推断改成в)。",
      "135в)原生包含x^2+y^2≤16与y≥4-x两条独立印刷行，不删方程、不减少印刷行来迎合行带。",
      "136正文引图25，正文句子完整，图在下一页待绑定；不写空ex cont，也不求解不等式组。",
      "未独立源审、未数学审批、未图审批。"
    ],
    "unknowns": [],
    "errata": [],
    "printed_lines": 25,
    "figures": [],
    "provenance": {
      "cap": "1",
      "normalized": true
    }
  },
  "blocks": [
    {
      "ref": "p0062#1",
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "133",
      "cont": true,
      "open": false,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "box": null,
      "lines": [
        "а) $\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x&\\geqslant0,\\\\↵y&\\leqslant0;\\end{aligned}\\right.$ б) $\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x&\\geqslant2,\\\\y&\\leqslant-1;\\end{aligned}\\right.$",
        "в) $\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}2&\\leqslant x<4.5,\\\\↵1&\\leqslant y\\leqslant5;\\end{aligned}\\right.$ г) $\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}-1&<x<2,\\\\-4&<y<-1.\\end{aligned}\\right.$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "ref": "p0062#2",
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "134",
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "box": null,
      "lines": [
        "134. 在坐标平面上，画细线条表示坐标满足下列不等式组的",
        "点的集合：",
        "а) $\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}y&\\geqslant2x+6,\\\\y&\\leqslant-2x+6;\\end{aligned}\\right.$ б) $\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}y&\\geqslant x+2,\\\\↵y&\\geqslant-x+2,\\\\↵y&\\leqslant5;\\end{aligned}\\right.$",
        "б) $\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}y-3x-6&\\leqslant0,\\\\2y-6x+3&\\geqslant0;\\end{aligned}\\right.$ г) $\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x+y&\\leqslant2,\\\\↵y-x&\\leqslant2,\\\\↵y&\\geqslant0.\\end{aligned}\\right.$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "ref": "p0062#3",
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "135",
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "box": null,
      "lines": [
        "135. 在坐标平面上，画细线条表示由下列不等式组给出的点",
        "的集合：",
        "а) $\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x^2+y^2&\\leqslant0.64,\\\\↵y&\\geqslant0;\\end{aligned}\\right.$",
        "б) $\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x^2+y^2&\\geqslant4,\\\\↵x^2+y^2&\\leqslant16;\\end{aligned}\\right.$",
        "в) $\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x^2+y^2&\\leqslant16,\\\\↵y&\\geqslant4-x;\\end{aligned}\\right.$",
        "г) $\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}y&\\geqslant x^2,\\\\↵y-4&\\leqslant0.\\end{aligned}\\right.$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "ref": "p0062#4",
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "136",
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "box": null,
      "lines": [
        "136. 图25中画细线条表示的都是由不等式组给出的点的集",
        "合，写出这些不等式组."
      ]
    },
    {
      "ref": "p0062#5",
      "kind": "foot",
      "label": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "box": null,
      "lines": [
        "55"
      ]
    }
  ]
